{
  "category": "Sludge Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Appears in filthy areas. Thrives by sucking up polluted sludge that is pumped out of factories.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Appears in filthy areas. Thrives by sucking up polluted sludge that is pumped out of factories.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "Made of hardened sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won't grow in its path.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "As it moves, it loses bits of its body from which new GRIMER emerge. This worsens the stench around it.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wherever GRIMER has passed, so many germs are left behind that no plants will ever grow again.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "When two of these POKéMON's bodies are combined together, new poisons are created.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "GRIMER’s sludgy and rubbery body can be forced through any opening, however small it may be. This POKéMON enters sewer pipes to drink filthy wastewater.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "GRIMER emerged from the sludge that settled on a polluted seabed. This POKéMON loves anything filthy. It constantly leaks a horribly germ- infested fluid from all over its body.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Born from polluted sludge in the sea, GRIMER’s favorite food is anything filthy. They feed on wastewater pumped out from factories.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sludge exposed to X rays from the moon transformed into GRIMER. It loves feeding on filthy things.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Appears in filthy areas. It thrives by sucking up polluted sludge that is pumped out of factories.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "As it moves, it loses bits of its body, from which new GRIMER emerge. This worsens the stench around it.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wherever GRIMER has passed, so many germs are left behind that no plants will ever grow again.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sludge exposed to X-rays from the moon transformed into Grimer. It loves feeding on filthy things.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Appears in filthy areas. It thrives by sucking up polluted sludge that is pumped out of factories.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grimer’s sludgy and rubbery body can be forced through any opening, however small it may be. This Pokémon enters sewer pipes to drink filthy wastewater.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grimer emerged from the sludge that settled on a polluted seabed. This Pokémon loves anything filthy. It constantly leaks a horribly germ-infested fluid from all over its body.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its main source of food is the slimy industrial waste of factories. This Pokémon’s numbers have been decreasing in recent years.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was born from sludge transformed by exposure to X-rays from the moon. When its internal load of germs decreases, it dies.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It was born from sludge on the ocean floor. In a sterile environment, the germs within its body can’t multiply, and it dies.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "The wastewater coming from factories is clean these days, so Grimer have nothing to eat. They’re said to be on the verge of extinction.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Made of congealed sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won’t grow in its path.",
      "version": "lets-go-pikachu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Made of congealed sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won’t grow in its path.",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    }
  ],
